            "title": "Is Kuber Resources' (KUBR) Efficiency Push Enough to Offset Quarterly Sales Weakness?",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Kuber Resources Corporation reported earnings for the third quarter and nine months ended September 30, 2025, showing a sharp year-over-year drop in quarterly sales to US$775,247 and net income to US$9,721. Despite quarterly weakness, the company\u2019s year-to-date net income more than doubled to US$3.1 million, pointing toward possible gains in efficiency or reduced costs. We'll now explore how improved year-to-date profitability amid quarterly sales weakness alters Kuber Resources' investment...",
